OL,3,GNEWSAWe all share a 15-acre Georgian
OL,4,Amansion for the price of a two-bed
OL,5,Ahouse
OL,6,
OL,7,FDreams of living in a Georgian manor
OL,8,Fhouse with 15 acres of grounds would
OL,9,Fusually be associated with a big
OL,10,Flottery win.
OL,12,FBut for the residents of Dol-llys Hall
OL,13,Fon the outskirts of Llanidloes, Powys,
OL,14,Fno windfall was necessary.
OL,16,FThe Grade II listed building is home to
OL,17,Fa collection of ordinary people who
OL,18,Fhave chosen to live cooperatively -
OL,19,Fsharing responsibility for maintaining
OL,20,Fthe home and its grounds and trying to
OL,21,Flive as sustainably as possible.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
