OL,3,GNEWSAWe all share a 15-acre Georgian
OL,4,Amansion for the price of a two-bed
OL,5,Ahouse
OL,6,
OL,7,F"You have got a ready-made village
OL,8,Fmentality where people just help each
OL,9,Fother out," says Louise Nicholson, one
OL,10,Fof the longest serving of 10 residents
OL,11,Fat the hall.
